I just released version 1.5.3 of STITCH. Changes compared to version 1.5.2 include

1. Significant speedups and some RAM improvements
2. Minor changes to heuristics

Website here
https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH

See here for benchmarks, notably towards the bottom for K=20
https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH/blob/master/benchmarks/summarize_benchmarking.md

Best,
Robbie

